      ⍝ Precision ? As to precision in general, different APL_Float and complex
      ⍝ variants produce slightly different results. We therefore check that the
      ⍝ precision is good enough (as opposed to compute the precise deviation).
      ⍝
      ⍝ for the same reason we round the result (with 6 2⍕ above and below).
      ⍝
      ⍝ lrm p. 174:   +/(L - R +.×Z)⋆2. We do not ⋆ 2
      ⍝
      1E¯14 > P←+/ V - M +.× Q   ⍝ precision ?
1

