      ⍝ over specified MM
      ⍝
      ⍝ V and M must have the same number of rows:    (↑⍴V) = (↑⍴M)
      ⍝ the rows of M must be linearly independent:   M[i;] ≠ ⍺×M[j;]
      ⍝ M must not have more columns than rows:       (↑⍴M) ≥ (1↓⍴M) 
      ⍝
      MM←5 4⍴M
       0 2⍕Q ← V ⌹ MM
