A⌹B : Bad shape 4 5 of argument B (expecting rows ≥ columns)


      ⍝ row count V ≠ row count MM
      ⍝
      MM←6 5⍴M
      V ⌹ MM
LENGTH ERROR+
      V⌹MM
      ^^

      )MORE
A⌹B : Bad rows 5 of argument A (expecting rows A = rows B = 6)


      ⍝ linear dependent MM
      ⍝
      MM←M ◊ MM[3;] ← 1.2×MM[1;] + 1.4×MM[2;]
       V ⌹ MM
DOMAIN ERROR+
      V⌹MM
      ^^

      )MORE
A⌹B : Bad rank 4 of complex argument B (expecting rank ≥ 5 for ⍴B = 5 5; is B linearly dependent? the estimated rank is controlled by ⎕CT)
